+ *  - the includes are replaced by: lcd_compat.h, lcd_seq_compat.h, lcd_modeset_compat.h, lcd_plane_compat.h, lcd_wm_compat.h;
+ *  - parity_bw_glue.inc (zedBSD code) is included at the end of the file.
